{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>IMPORTANT:\u00a0</strong>This is a chaotic and stressful management game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Its NOT a cozy or relaxing experience. It\u2019s the WORST job ever, can you survive it?!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your boss just left for vacation. He's calling from a beach chair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're surrounded by packages, screaming machines, and a budget that's bleeding money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Parcel Frenzy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udce6 THE JOB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort packages by weight. Stack pallets under 60kg. Label. Seal. Ship. Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds simple? It's not.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wrong sort?</strong> Fined.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Machine explodes?</strong> Your problem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go bankrupt?</strong> You're in trouble!.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your shift runs 08:00 to 22:00. The chaos never stops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc7b THE HAUNTED SHIFT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a cursed graveyard where past workers demand deliveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill ghost orders. Load coffins. and earn reputation in this crazy minigame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit 10,000 Rep to enter the <strong>global leaderboard</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf84 SEASONAL CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Halloween and Christmas themes with unique decorations and radio music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play during the season to unlock permanently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf19 NIGHT SHIFT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss asleep. Relaxed radio. Work at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only relaxing mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u26a1 SPEED SORTING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boxes fly. Boss screams LEFT, MIDDLE, RIGHT.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab. Throw. Don\u2019t miss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboards included.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc80 CAN YOU KEEP THE COMPANY ALIVE?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will you join the ghosts?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2b50 WISHLIST NOW ON STEAM \u2b50</h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Thats in!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3899400/b5da2ff7b951d3d5279d01a3e8428ed4c447a839.jpg"},{"name":"So thats how you do it!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3899400/a773ed9409b333a3fe35ef9bf7aa94e943e91455.jpg"},{"name":"Boxes here, Boxes there, i see boxes everywhere!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3899400/57d2ea069770f762b0618ded6a0f19dec57acaed.jpg"},{"name":"Seal, Ship, Repeat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3899400/951c551e769052034fb7db7dce047efb9842d275.jpg"},{"name":"Oh... Not again!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3899400/28a59db66721ebb56a342032140381cc3d66e477.jpg"},{"name":"First day in my new home...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3899400/9443d35b5f1156d6015b0797c5bec26580c6d544.jpg"},{"name":"Thats no challenge for me!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3899400/1c2f5556eeb126f9b96a7f970cd1c09a4870e0ca.jpg"},{"name":"W Upgrade!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/